# Signing keys and signed builds, which never belong in a public repository.
# The upload key for Google Play (.jks/.keystore) and Apple's .p8 should live
# outside every clone - see docs/payments.md - and these lines are only the
# net under that rule, for the day one is saved in the wrong folder.
*.jks
*.keystore
*.p8
*.p12
*.aab
*.apk
